# asusd-user panicked at startup with
#   "Cannot start a runtime from within a runtime"
# because #[tokio::main] entered the Tokio runtime before the zbus *blocking*
# proxies were constructed; zbus blocking objects call Runtime::block_on
# internally. Do all blocking setup in a plain main(), then create a
# current_thread runtime and run the async server tasks inside block_on().
#
# Upstream status at 13cdaa9 (2026-10-28): not fixed. See PATCHES.md before
# updating.
